    {
      "id": "why-this-boss-matters",
      "type": "overview",
      "title": "Why This Boss Matters",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "order": 3,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Ignagduk is the source of a permanent +30 Maximum Spirit — a rare, account-progression resource that expands your skill setup for the rest of the game. That alone justifies the optional fight.",
        "She is not a difficulty wall; the value is the reward. Plan the kill around securing both drops and the buff."
      ],
      "bullets": [
        "Permanent +30 Maximum Spirit.",
        "Rare account-progression resource.",
        "Worth it even though optional."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ritual-buff-route",
      "type": "overview",
      "title": "Ritual Buff Route (Fire Resistance)",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "order": 4,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Before the fight, the Azak Bog ritual grants Ignagduk's Harvest Buff, a Fire Resistance buff. Collect the five Effigies first to enable the buff, then fight with the resistance online.",
        "The buff is a fight aid, not a permanent reward — it can fade after death. Use it during the attempt, do not rely on it afterward."
      ],
      "bullets": [
        "Five Effigies enable the Fire Resist buff.",
        "Buff aids the fight, not permanent.",
        "Can fade on death — use it in the attempt."
      ]
    },
