    {
      "id": "reward-claim-flow",
      "type": "overview",
      "title": "Reward Claim Flow",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "order": 7,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Kill Ignagduk, then two items drop. Gemrot Skull must be right-clicked to consume for the permanent +30 Maximum Spirit. Ignagduk's Ghastly Spear is a separate drop handed to Servi to complete Tribal Vengeance and claim the quest reward.",
        "They are NOT the same reward and Spirit is NOT auto-granted by the kill or by talking to Servi. If your Spirit did not increase, you likely did not consume the Skull."
      ],
      "bullets": [
        "Kill Ignagduk.",
        "Gemrot Skull -> right-click use -> +30 Spirit (permanent).",
        "Ghastly Spear -> give to Servi -> quest reward.",
        "Two separate rewards; Skull use is required for Spirit."
      ]
    },
