      "title": "Build Considerations",
      "toc": true,
      "visible": true,
      "order": 9,
      "paragraphs": [
        "Ignagduk is a moderate fight; the challenge is securing the reward, not surviving. Fire Resistance and the ritual buff make the kill trivial for most builds.",
        "Melee must wait for her landing windows; ranged can pressure during flight but should respect the flame lanes."
      ],
      "bullets": [
        "Melee: hit on landing windows.",
        "Ranged: pressure in flight, dodge flame.",
        "Fire Resist + buff simplifies the kill.",
        "Focus on the reward claim, not the damage."
